ants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4-vRC6g1LOXyXXe4EfxBwg","review_id":"_P3tocv0hZJfKQMIWKq3Dg","date":"2011-09-16T23:54:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9502722024917603,"text_excerpt":"Getting here is a feather in my cap. I told myself I'd stroll through the Treme a bit and walking from the French Quarter to this bulletproof glassed liquor store turned Asian restaurant made sure I accomplished this goal. Honestly, I've been through worse neighborhoods so I'd argue that the edge of Treme is not too bad. The spot itself was quite the sight. It was basically a liquor store with what looked like a bank teller window at the front. But instead of bank tellers there were some older Asian woman taking your order for Chinese food and wings. The menu is a wooden sign that's handwritten and looks like they were running out of space when they did it. In the corner, you'll find a Ch..."},{"business_id":"4-vRC6g1LOXyXXe4EfxBwg","review_id":"I-yKGSuNUvDfJRLsvd2nLQ","date":"2021-08-11T16:29:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9414575099945068,"text_excerpt":"Can't go wrong with Manchu. If you're visiting New Orleans, it's a staple to come here and try their wings. They're known for their plates of wings and fried rice. If you're at a big party in Nola with family and guests for the holidays, you will be sure to find Manchu fried wings. They *pack* their combos and plates up full, so you're getting your money's worth. Not to mention, it's also pretty cheap if you're craving wings. I will say, they are kind of on the saltier side (nothing crazy) but that's why they're so good. It's a tiny corner store, people are usually in and out very quickly. They have snacks, alcohol, drinks as well for purchase. Service is extremely fast. Come give this pl..."},{"business_id":"4-vRC6g1LOXyXXe4EfxBwg","review_id":"5IJl9FcS0wIJOp6GWyNGog","date":"2017-01-24T21:01:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9305301904678345,"text_excerpt":"YELPERS were correct!These wings are great!! I didn't see any special flavors but the fried had a slight kick to them. The crust is crunchy and it was good. It is a few blocks down the street from the wing place with the \"ghetto punch\" ....Manchu's chicken is better In the day time the area is full of characters but I felt safe. All of the food is to-go, there is nowhere on property to eat. NOTE: parking is limited and when parked in front of the property I saw someone back in, so they could pull out. Ohhhh my ....... that was a smart move. It is the door to the right, I entered the door to the screen door to the left and walked into a clean kitchen. They were gracious ......"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4-vRC6g1LOXyXXe4EfxBwg","photo_id":"c5M9rdNuzCpC1UpkweUpdA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/c5M9rdNuzCpC1UpkweUpdA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8990522027015686},{"business_id":"4-vRC6g1LOXyXXe4EfxBwg","photo_id":"r8JW3PQNYmQ6aOCerffqXw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/r8JW3PQNYmQ6aOCerffqXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8225858807563782},{"business_id":"4-vRC6g1LOXyXXe4EfxBwg","photo_id":"OgyCAY3tc3q